    "Single getter metadata capability and exact native type/plan identity validation",
    "1000-parent, direct plus pivot aggregate benchmark asserts 1+2+2 statements and complete hydration"
  ],
  "corrections": [
    "Wrapped the new test scanner method to match func(*int64) any; production build was already successful.",
    "Cloned predicate slices before aggregate aliasing and before appending grouped key filters; added a regression assertion.",
    "Moved aggregate-bearing fixture models to models/aggregates so legacy joined probes retain their original model workload; all existing ceilings pass unchanged.",
