  "docs_notes": [
    "Stage 4d now implements typed ValueOf slots and expr.Related computations through existing With/Load/LoadMissing.",
    "Result families and FILTER reuse 6a3; one-of-many, MorphTo and eager aggregate inputs fail validation; cardinality checks remain unfiltered.",
    "Per-slot statement parity is retained without fusion. All 54 footprint probes retain existing ceilings; six catalogue rows are ported.",
    "Requested scoped acceptance rerun passed, including source provenance regressions and the 1000-parent two-slot benchmark (5 statements/op in all five runs). Live PostgreSQL remains for the lead; lead-owned docs were not edited."
  ],
